      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T20:06:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`SSHHelper(host)` with no `_user` → paramiko falls back to `getpass.getuser()` (the quads daemon\u0027s own uid), not necessarily root, and ssh-config `User` is ignored since `connect()` only reads `identityfile`. `cloudcmd` connects as `root@host` explicitly; this plugin should too (`SSHHelper(host, \"root\")`) to make the RFE\u0027s \u0027SSH as root\u0027 guarantee hold, otherwise `/root` writes fail with permission denied if the daemon ever runs as non-root.",
      "revId": "507fa047873007a586df936f8b7901bd3aa38c8d",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
